{"id":"662211","name":"蒜香排骨","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662211/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"380克"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2头"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"零卡糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：排骨（已浸泡并清洗干净）、蒜。","img":"images/662211/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将蒜剥去蒜皮放入绞蒜机里。","img":"images/662211/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖上盖，绞碎。","img":"images/662211/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"开盖。","img":"images/662211/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"随后，在排骨里加适量的料酒。","img":"images/662211/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/662211/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/662211/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/662211/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的零卡糖。","img":"images/662211/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搁入蒜末。","img":"images/662211/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调味抓匀腌制3个小时左右。","img":"images/662211/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"接着，将腌制好的排骨放入铺有抹了油的铝箔纸开盘里。","img":"images/662211/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"在盖上铝箔纸。","img":"images/662211/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"烤箱预热，放入排骨220度，烤25分钟。","img":"images/662211/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"然后，将上面的铝箔纸去掉、把排骨翻个面。","img":"images/662211/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再次进入烤箱里烤15分钟。","img":"images/662211/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"最后，开门取出。","img":"images/662211/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"装入盘中，上桌可以吃吃了。","img":"images/662211/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"根据自家的烤箱时间而定。。。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}